{"version":1,"key":"card:450","content":{"id":450,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有条件地执行代码，如果条件为真，就执行后续代码块；如果条件为假，就不执行"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"name = input('What is your name?')\nif name.endswith('Gumby'):\n    print('Hello, Mr. Gumby')","language":"py","uuid":"7ffd7306-952b-4700-a3f4-120ed173db39","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"else","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句增加一种选择。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"name = input('What is your name?')\nif name.endswith('Gumby'):\n    print('Hello, Mr. Gumby')\nelse:\n    print('Hello, stranger')","language":"py","uuid":"d6b63714-d872-4d91-988c-77ec84a2df07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"条件表达式，语法"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"value_if_true if condition else value_if_false","language":"py","uuid":"86c48c65-c37d-45d6-b112-f360cabacc55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> name = \"Alice\"\n>>> status = \"friend\" if name.endswith(\"Gumby\") else \"stranger\"\n>>> status\n'stranger'","language":"py","uuid":"326cb1d3-038c-4fdd-a9de-ddd610941bc4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"检查多个条件，可使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"elif","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"elif","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"else if","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的缩写"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"num = int(input('Enter a number: '))\nif num > 0:\n    print('The number is positive')\nelif num < 0:\n    print('The number is negative')\nelse:\n    print('The number is zero')","language":"py","uuid":"2d60fa78-f2d6-4888-804f-022828d734e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Python"],"createTime":171